   "source": [
    "## 7. Compute Gap-Aware Rolling Features\n",
    "\n",
    "Now we recompute rolling features **within each session**. This ensures statistics never cross recording gaps."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": [
      "=== GAP-AWARE ROLLING FEATURES (NORMAL) ===\n",
