    "## 9. Inspect Missing Values\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why Do We Have Missing Values?\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Change features** (`diff()`): First row has no previous value → `NaN`\n",
    "2. **Rolling window 5**: First 4 rows don't have 5 previous values → `NaN`\n",
    "3. **Rolling window 15**: First 14 rows don't have 15 previous values → `NaN`\n",
    "4. **Session boundaries**: First row of each new session has no history in that session → `NaN` for rolling features\n",
    "\n",
